      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NON STOP RECALL (4) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in five starts, including three wins and two placings. Scored by a neck last time (19.01) in a Mix 5 over 350m at Q Straight. Makes strong appeal on best. LOST DRAGON (2) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has hit the frame at her last three runs, the latest finishing third (20.02) at Capalaba. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to her credit. Deserves a win and gets her chance. MAIN WAY (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished second (22.20) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from eight attempts. Expected to be in the finish again. LEGS ELEVEN (7) must be among the chances on the last run here.",
